# The TSIG key `homelab.dns`'s external-dns authorises its RFC2136 updates
# with, and the same string as `lab.dns.tsigSecret` — which is where Knot gets
# it. `lab-tsig-key-agrees` compares the two, because the failure when they
# differ is a bare NOTAUTH from a controller that logs nothing above debug.
#
# Committed on purpose, and not a secret in any useful sense: it authorises
# updates to a throwaway zone served on loopback, and it is already a literal
# in `modules/lab/network/dns.nix`.
CATA_SECRET_AUTHORED__EXTERNALDNS_TSIG__TSIG_SECRET='kp4bgnFAVCmajGIqOW7rj0MNwRNZHBqMvYaLTwzPHgI='
